{% extends '@rental/management/_booking_frame.html.twig' %}
{#
  « Finances » — the money of one booking (Booking\BookingPage::FINANCES,
  chantier #927 §2.4), in a strict order: the summary, the movements of
  the account reconciled with the booking's receivable, then how to pay —
  or, once something is owed back, how to refund.

  ONE receivable — the rental price plus the security deposit — and one
  structured communication for the deposit, the balance, the security
  deposit and any complement. Nothing here edits a price: it changes on
  « Modifications » (lot D).

  The three cards sit under the payment box's anchor
  (Booking\BookingBox::PAYMENT), which is where a journey line about the
  money lands. Each region an action can change is its own
  `data-booking-panel`, refreshed in place by rental-booking.js.

  A booking Finances follows (`payment.tracked`: a receivable exists and
  Finance answers for it) always gets the three cards, even with payments
  switched off on the asset since: Finance still reconciles its
  communication, so the account — never a hand-typed return — says where
  the deposit went. Only an untracked booking — the module off, or
  payments off before any receivable — shows that the payments are
  followed outside the site, with the deposit's return recorded here by
  hand (§2.6).

  Requires the context of RentalManagementController::financesContext().
#}
{% block booking_content %}
    <div id="{{ boxes.payment.anchor }}">
        {% if payment.tracked|default(false) or (payment.available and payment.enabled) %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_finance_summary.html.twig' %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_finance_movements.html.twig' %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_finance_instructions.html.twig' %}
        {% else %}
            {% include '@rental/management/_finance_off.html.twig' %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}

{% block booking_scripts %}
    {# Keeps the screen awake while the enlarged QR is on it. #}
    <script src="{{ asset('/assets/js/payment-qr.js') }}" defer></script>
{% endblock %}
